OL,3,GNEWSAData centre consultation 'a sales
OL,4,Apitch'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say they are being "led down
OL,7,Fthe garden path" over plans for a major
OL,8,Fdata centre.
OL,10,FUS-based developer Tract wants to build
OL,11,FDurham Technology Park on land between
OL,12,Fthe villages of South Hetton, Murton
OL,13,Fand Easington Lane in County Durham.
OL,15,FTwo public consultation events saw
OL,16,Fconcerns about noise, traffic, water
OL,17,Fsupplies and the size of the complex,
OL,18,Fwith one local describing the
OL,19,Fconsultation as a "sales pitch".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
